{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15450","headline":"野寺病居喜卢纶见访 · 李端","name":"野寺病居喜卢纶见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青青麦壠白云阴，古寺无人新草深。\n乳燕拾泥依古井，鸣鸠拂羽历花林。\n千年驳藓明山履，万尺垂萝入水心。\n一卧漳滨今欲老，谁知才子忽相寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15450.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15450","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}